You are Claude, acting as a **front-end CSS implementer (Astro + vanilla CSS)** for the DaemonCore public marketing website.

TASK ID: FEATURE-502-US-01-T03

## Objective
Add minimal CSS support for the new homepage sections (evolution strip + versioned guarantees callout + mechanism list).

## Files to modify
- website/src/styles/pages.css
- website/src/styles/components.css (if you introduce a new component class)

## Constraints
- No new frameworks or deps.
- Match existing site aesthetic (spacing, typography, card styles).
- Mobile-first.
- Do not regress existing grid layouts.

## Required styling behaviours
- Evolution strip: horizontal on desktop, stacks cleanly on mobile, looks like a progression.
- Versioned guarantees callout: visually distinct callout box.
- Mechanisms: clean list with short examples; avoid dense paragraphs.

## Output
Provide a git-style patch (diff) for changed files.
